{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/damac-islands-damac-properties-dubailand","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1277,"crm_id":"3027","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"DAMAC Islands Phase 2","slug":"damac-islands-damac-properties-dubailand","display_address":"Dubailand","building_type":["townhouse","villa"],"completion_year":"2030","developer":"DAMAC Properties","price":2750000,"display_price":"2.75M","lattitude":25.0227332,"longitude":55.2957332,"min_bedrooms":4,"max_bedrooms":5,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>DAMAC Islands Phase 2 in <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/dubailand/\">Dubailand </a>is an exciting new residential development by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-damac-properties/\">DAMAC Properties</a>. Located near Meraas Cherrywoods and Sun City, it features a premium collection of <strong>4 and 5-bedroom townhouses along with spacious 5-bedroom villas</strong>. The covered area of these units range from 2,208 to 3,178 sq.ft. and plot sizes between 1,770 sq. ft. and 3,178 sq.ft.</p><p>The clusters of DAMAC Islands 2 include eight unique clusters, named Mauritius, Maui, Cuba, Barbados, Bermuda, Tahiti, and the Bahamas.</p><p>The price of 4-bedroom units starts from AED 2.75 million, while 3-bedroom residences are available from AED 3.75 million.Discover experiences that awaken your senses; from tranquil lagoons and lush jungle rivers to thrilling water adventures and serene escapes, all blending into an idyllic paradise.</p><p>DAMAC Islands II combines a prime location, the credibility of a trusted developer, and strong ROI potential. Launching soon, Phase 2 by DAMAC Properties is set to become a landmark destination, with full details and specificat